Shade
=====

Shade is Charon's emulator for legacy iPhone OS and iOS userlands on macOS
arm64 hosts. It is licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0; see LICENSE.

The JIT core, kept as a separate submodule, is licensed under the BSD Zero
Clause License; see the LICENSE in its tree.

